    <Relevance><![CDATA[(windows of operating system) and (version of operating system >= "6.1") and (if exists property "in proxy agent context" then ( not in proxy agent context ) else true) and (free space of drive of client > 7052578 * 2) and (exists value "DisplayVersion" whose (it as string as version < "6.5.0") of keys whose (value "DisplayName" of it as string starts with "PeaZip") of keys "HKLM\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Uninstall" of (x32 registries; x64 registries))]]></Relevance>
